From: fyde-nix
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rockchip: enable eMMC command queueing on FydeTab Duo

The sdhci-of-dwcmshc CQE backport only takes effect when the eMMC
controller node advertises supports-cqe. Enable it on &sdhci so the
RK3588 eMMC controller uses the command queue.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-fydetab_duo.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-fydetab_duo.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-fydetab_duo.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-fydetab_duo.dts
@@ -524,10 +524,11 @@
 &sdhci {
   bus-width = <8>;
   no-sdio;
   no-sd;
   non-removable;
+  supports-cqe;
   max-frequency = <200000000>;
   mmc-hs400-1_8v;
   mmc-hs400-enhanced-strobe;
   status = "okay";
 };
